{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/21054-demons-angels-and-twilight","id":21054,"title":"demons, angels and twilight","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Demon: The Descent"],"posts":[{"date":"2013-12-01T01:41:34-08:00","id":21054,"title":"demons, angels and twilight","content":"Hi maybe I'm overlooking something here, but can it be that angels are quite outclassing demons when they are using twilight to their advantage?<br /> <br /> From a lookover I didn't see much (anything) that allows a demon to see / hit something in twilight (only the resonance radar helps them pinpoint things).<br /> <br /> But angels on the other hand with the right numina can reach across to the physical realm and harm demons there, thus if those with teh appropriate numina use that to their advantage they could follow demons unseen and without problems (spirits,.. can't harm them anyway) and can strike at them without any chance of retaliating.<br /> <br /> Or am I overlooking something here?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":914,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/914-ryu","user":"Ryu","date":". 12-01-2013, 04:50 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/914-ryu","name":"Ryu","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"330"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-12-01T02:34:33-08:00","id":21073,"title":"","content":"They have to physically manifest first in order to use there numina. If you're thinking of reaching, that only applies if there in the shadow, not twilight","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/991-pgolasze13","name":"pgolasze13","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"113"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-12-01T05:27:43-08:00","id":21124,"title":"","content":"From what I've read there are few (if any) Embeds/ Exploits/ Demonic Form Abilities that allow Demons to influence Twilight entities. These beings (be they Angels, Ghosts or Spirits) must Manifest in order to use Numina/ Influences on the physical world or have the Reaching Numen if they're in the Shadow, but not all of them can materialize physically meaning that while they've Manifested, they still cannot be touched by the Physical. So Demons would have to, I assume, look for Bans and Banes to hit Angels where it hurts - an advantage Demons have over Angels that doesn't work the other way round.<br /> <br /> So yes, while a clever Angel might be able to take on a Demon without so much as a scratch, a clever Demon will be able to use Bans/ Banes to hurt the Angel - or at least use any of the <b><i>many </i></b>powers they have to get the hell out of dodge <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/933-shadowhowler","name":"shadowhowler","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar933_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"49"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}